subckt dut (VDD VSS Vcont)
C1 (VDD net0) capacitor c=1p
C1B (VDD net2) capacitor c=1p
ISS (net1 VSS) isource dc=1m
L1 (VDD net0) inductor l=1n
L2 (VDD net2) inductor l=1n
M1 (net0 net2 net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net2 net0 net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Mv1 (Vcont net0 Vcont Vcont) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Mv2 (Vcont net2 Vcont Vcont) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RP (VDD net0) resistor r=1k
Rp2 (VDD net2) resistor r=1k
